// A module-level `let` whose initializer performs an effect nothing
// handles. The contract is the refusal: the program root reaches a perform
// with no install.
//
// Measured 2026-09-23 through the pinned boot: check clean, then an
// out-of-bounds fault in the module initializer. A module value has no
// frame, so its initializer's charge was dropped where a function body's
// would land. Retires when the module initializer is a frame the root gate
// reads (Hβ.effects.rows-are-propagated-cells).
effect E { op() -> Int }
let x = op()
fn main() = x
